      "id": "p0101-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In 1993, Enix released a Super Famicom action role-playing game known as Gaia Gensōki (\"Gaia Fantasy Chronicle\") in Japan. An English version debuted as Illusion of Gaia in North America in 1994, and as Illusion of Time in Europe in 1995. The English script features many translation mishaps and unusual localization choices that remain memorable to this day.",
